    <summary>Ask questions, get instant answers with sources. The AI search engine that understands what you're actually looking for.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[## Perplexity

Perplexity is an AI-powered search engine and assistant that delivers direct, accurate answers with cited sources. It understands natural language questions and synthesises information from across the web in real time.

**Key features:**

- Ask anything in plain language and get immediate, sourced answers
- Follow-up questions maintain context throughout the conversation
- Access to real-time web information
- Supports file uploads, image understanding, and document analysis
- Focus modes for targeted searches (Academic, YouTube, Reddit, and more)
- Available across Windows, macOS, iOS, and Android

### Package-specific issue
If this package isn't up-to-date for some days, [Create an issue](https://github.com/tunisiano187/Chocolatey-packages/issues/new/choose)

